$ yo doc --help
Usage: yo doc [path] [options]

Generate API documentation for .yo files.

Options:
  -o, --output <dir>        Output directory (default: ./yo-out/doc)
  -f, --format <fmt>        Output format (html|markdown|json, default html)
  --title <s>               Documentation site title
  --version <v>             Release version (auto-detects from git if omitted)
  --logo <path>             Image shown in the sidebar header
  --favicon <path>          Site icon
  --document-private        Include underscore-private items
  -v, --verbose             Verbose output
  --std-path <dir>          Override the std library directory
  --allow-token-only        Document modules the evaluator cannot load from
                            tokens only (no signatures); without this they
                            fail the run

Examples:
  $ yo doc ./std
  $ yo doc ./src/main.yo -o docs --format json
